(Bug #80: a thing instance declared BELOW a function is readable inside it.
 LANGUAGE.md: "Variables declared at top level are global and can be used
 inside functions" - and attaches no ordering condition to that. Only a
 thing DEFINITION has to stand above its uses, and it does here.)

